100.000').\"}, \"price_levels\": {\"liqquote\": \"A NUMERIC(12,3) liquidation price estimate (e.g., '25000.750').\", \"stopquote\": \"A NUMERIC(12,3) stop price (e.g., '27000.000').\", \"traildiff\": \"A DECIMAL(12,3) trailing delta (e.g., '150.500').\", \"trigquote\": \"A DECIMAL(12,3) advanced trigger price (e.g., '26950.250').\"}, \"risk_factors\": {\"cpfactor\": \"A VARCHAR(30) label for counterparty risk (e.g., 'Tier2Counterparty').\", \"custfactor\": \"A VARCHAR(30) custody risk label (e.g., 'ColdStorage').\", \"liqfactor\": \"A VARCHAR(20) label for liquidation risk (e.g., 'HighRisk').\", \"netfactor\": \"A VARCHAR(30) network risk label (e.g., 'ChainCongestion').\", \"regfactor\": \"A VARCHAR(30) regulatory risk label (e.g., 'RestrictedRegion').\", \"setfactor\": \"A VARCHAR(30) settlement risk label (e.g., 'DailySettle').\"}}}", x.status="asserted", x.confidence=0.80;
