ywallband\": \"A DECIMAL(10,3) measuring buy wall distance (e.g., '450.500').\", \"sellwallband\": \"A DECIMAL(10,3) measuring sell wall distance (e.g., '480.250').\"}}}", x.status="asserted", x.confidence=0.80;
